<title>JAPAN: Yamato International - 95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Yamato International - 95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to November 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.38		vs	   22.77</p>
<p> Operating	 prft 53 million    vs    loss 16    million</p>
<p> Current	   prft 49 million    vs    loss 98    million</p>
<p> Net		   51    million    vs	   89    million</p>
<p> EPS		    1.70 yen	  vs	    2.92 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	  1.70 yen	  vs	    2.92 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamato International Inc is a wholesaler of fashion wear.</p>
